# settings-home: the real main screen with the firmware's real Ajustes window
# open over it. The path is the firmware's own:
# main_screen_action(ACTION_APP_SETTINGS) -> src/main_screen.c
# (main_screen_start_app) -> src/dialog.c (dialog_construct/dialog_init) ->
# src/dialog_settings.c (the whole grid: date/time, clock, backlight, info,
# audio, spectrum, waterfall, operations, appearance and the action dropdowns).
#
# The dialog opens on its first group (Reloj), so the render shows the date/time
# and clock rows plus the tab bar the dialog loads with buttons_load_page().
# Deterministic: the date/time fields read the harness' fixed clock, not the
# host's (tools/ui_harness/CMakeLists.txt links with `--wrap=time`).

name settings-home
screen settings-home

seed 20

frequency_hz 14074000
tx_frequency_hz 14074000
fft_width_hz 384000

mode usb
vfo A
agc auto

split false
att false
pre false
atu false
ant 1

smeter_db -73

battery_v 12.1
external_v 13.8
battery_cap 76
charging false

rxtx rx
